@startuml
title RF3 — Gerenciar a conta (dados, sessões, segurança, LGPD, notificações) · Máquina de estados: DataExportJob.status
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "REQUESTED" as REQUESTED
state "READY" as READY
READY : JSON + CSV no S3 privado
READY : 24 h
state "EXPIRED" as EXPIRED
state "FAILED" as FAILED
[*] --> REQUESTED
REQUESTED --> READY : processado pelo Scheduler
REQUESTED --> FAILED : erro
READY --> EXPIRED : 24 h
EXPIRED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
@enduml
